---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="Affiliate Disclosure" description="RWA Wire affiliate disclosure and information about commercial relationships.">
<section class="wire-container max-w-3xl py-16 sm:py-24">
  <p class="eyebrow text-wire">DISCLOSURE //</p>
  <h1 class="mt-4 font-serif text-4xl font-medium text-ink sm:text-5xl">Affiliate Disclosure</h1>
  <div class="prose prose-invert mt-10 max-w-none">
    <p>Some links on RWA Wire are affiliate links. If you register for or use a service through one of these links, RWA Wire may receive a commission or other compensation at no additional cost to you.</p>
    <p>RWA Wire currently has an affiliate relationship with Bitunix. Affiliate relationships help support the publication, but they do not guarantee positive editorial coverage and should not be interpreted as an endorsement of any asset, trade or investment strategy.</p>
    <p>Crypto assets and leveraged trading can involve substantial risk. Readers should conduct their own research and consider their circumstances before using any financial or trading service. Nothing published by RWA Wire constitutes personalized investment, financial, legal or tax advice.</p>
  </div>
</section>
</BaseLayout>
